---------------------
GITHUB_TOKEN        GitHub PAT with ``repo`` + ``workflow`` scopes.
PROACTIVE_DRY_RUN   Set to ``1`` to skip comment posting (print only).
PROACTIVE_MAX_AGE_H Max age in hours of failed runs to consider (default 24).
