This utility compiles the repository lockfile according to the
Atomic Diff 5 dependency specification, checks that pinned versions
satisfy the declared constraints, and validates that pip can resolve
the lock without conflicts. Each modifying step is resilient: errors
are captured and appended to `_codex_reports/errors_<date>.md` so the
workflow can continue executing subsequent steps.

Note: `_codex_reports/` is used for NEW error reports generated by this script.
Historical reports have been moved to `misc/repo-owner-review/deprecated-reports/`.

Usage:

```bash
python scripts/refresh_requirements_lock.py            # compile + validate
python scripts/refresh_requirements_lock.py --skip-compile  # validate existing lock
python scripts/refresh_requirements_lock.py --skip-validate # generate lock without pip dry-run
```
